  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: memory budget exhaustion when the pixel cache\n     allocation fails\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-86420.patch: relinquish the MemoryResource\n       budget when the pixel allocation fails in OpenPixelCache() in\n       magick/cache.c\n     - CVE-2026-86420\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: memory leak in the MSL decoder on group end tags\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-86421.patch: destroy draw_info for each\n       grouped image in the group cleanup loop in MSLEndElement() in\n       coders/msl.c\n     - CVE-2026-86421",
